{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/cedb469723b971ee8965a0fb35537711.avif?t=1753905596\" width=500 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pulsar Crash is a 2D twin-stick shooter which throws you into head-to-head space battles where the competitive spirit of fighting games meets bullet-hell chaos.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/6fe170ed833561662a1704e61bcd2a20.poster.avif?t=1753905596\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/6fe170ed833561662a1704e61bcd2a20.webm?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/6fe170ed833561662a1704e61bcd2a20.mp4?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face off in intense multiplayer showdowns with up to four players!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control agile starships with distinct abilities and crush your enemies in top-down, arena-style combat in a thrilling space-western setting, with an over-the-top visual style and an electrifying funk/fusion soundtrack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/f499fffd21c3cb6f4075be90a46b9563.poster.avif?t=1753905596\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/f499fffd21c3cb6f4075be90a46b9563.webm?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/f499fffd21c3cb6f4075be90a46b9563.mp4?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your pilot. Master your play style.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight pilots each with unique core abilities tailored for aggressive brawlers, agile tacticians, and everything in between.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/05849908e38097caff14eaeb93966b3b.poster.avif?t=1753905596\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/05849908e38097caff14eaeb93966b3b.webm?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/05849908e38097caff14eaeb93966b3b.mp4?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your loadout\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully select a secondary weapon to pair with your pilot. Collect Pulsar Orbs during the match to use your secondary weapon and unique ship ability!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/4e8175b305972445f568f3cb3b197ca5.poster.avif?t=1753905596\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/4e8175b305972445f568f3cb3b197ca5.webm?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/4e8175b305972445f568f3cb3b197ca5.mp4?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle across five dynamic stages\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages are divided into multiple maps, with each round taking place on a new map. Each stage is designed around a central easy-to-understand, challenging-to-master mechanic.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/c332d96a068c5f0565f799579b6da411.poster.avif?t=1753905596\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/c332d96a068c5f0565f799579b6da411.webm?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/c332d96a068c5f0565f799579b6da411.mp4?t=1753905596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local chaos, global competition\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your next game night a hit with frantic 4-player free for all, prove yourself in hyper-competitive head-to-head local matches, or find online matches through our Discord server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/83cbe8a98f8da69ded10011cc311f815.avif?t=1753905596\" width=288 height=162 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1295290?t=1753905596","background_raw":"https://store.a